[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10080.63, "timestamp": "02:48:00", "text": "好的。没有我维护，而且，不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10084.23, "timestamp": "02:48:04", "text": "我可以远程维护它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10088.469, "timestamp": "02:48:08", "text": "是的。但是，仍然存在内部问题。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10093.269, "timestamp": "02:48:13", "text": "呃，我得想想，如果……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10096.79, "timestamp": "02:48:16", "text": "BIOS 并不能解决所有这些问题。现在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10099.91, "timestamp": "02:48:19", "text": "希望这种情况不会发生，否则我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10103.349, "timestamp": "02:48:23", "text": "完了，兄弟。或者我必须像这样付钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10106.63, "timestamp": "02:48:26", "text": "很多？我关掉那个窗口了吗？否则我就得付钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10110.309, "timestamp": "02:48:30", "text": "每月90美元即可拥有云端OBS"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10113.67, "timestamp": "02:48:33", "text": "服务器，我不想这么做。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10115.99, "timestamp": "02:48:35", "text": "我很想做，但是算了。不，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10118.15, "timestamp": "02:48:38", "text": "破产了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10121.51, "timestamp": "02:48:41", "text": "呃，我觉得我可以做60个。不，不，等等。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10123.429, "timestamp": "02:48:43", "text": "需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10125.03, "timestamp": "02:48:45", "text": "萨米和一切都好，对吧？所以，我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10126.87, "timestamp": "02:48:46", "text": "做90。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10133.51, "timestamp": "02:48:53", "text": "我自己都不知道这种情况是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10137.83, "timestamp": "02:48:57", "text": "如果我能够做到，我就能做到。"}]